      "solution_text": "$\\frac{7a}{8} - \\frac{a+2}{6}$\n$= \\frac{21a}{24} - \\frac{4(a+2)}{24}$\n$= \\frac{21a - 4(a+2)}{24}$\n$= \\frac{21a-4a-8}{24}$\n$= \\frac{17a-8}{24}$"
