        { "text": "$\\frac{m+10}{10}$", "why": "Left the first numerator as $2(m+3)$ without also multiplying it by $2$ to reach tenths." },
        { "text": "$\\frac{3m+16}{5}$", "why": "Kept $5$ as the denominator after rewriting both numerators over $10$." }
